    "This method makes use of the relation between impulse response $h[n]$ and frequency response $H[f]$ through the Fourier transform:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "H[f] = \\mathcal{F}\\{ h[t]\\}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
